	"name": "Nameless Bloodstained Monument",
	"description": "A Domain sealed by the power of the North Wind. Once a place where knights stained the earth with demon blood, it was also where they laid their swords and bones to rest.\\n\"A knight hath no need of graven stone, for justice itself shall be his memorial.\"\\n\"A knight hath no need of bonds, for justice itself doth walk beside him.\"\\n\"A knight hath no need of triumph, for a biting wind shall bear him home.\"",
